# Function & Code Style

Follow `docs/agent/function-style.md` for full examples.

## Rules (summary)

1. Return early — edge cases first
2. No nesting — sequential early returns, no `else if`
3. Extract complex logic into named functions
4. `const` only — never `let`
5. Options object for 2+ parameters
6. Consistent null guards per function
7. Extract compound conditions to named `const`
8. In React/JSX: prefer early returns for loading/error/empty states
